'''3rd Round: Dawn (Deadly)''' is one of the possible [[Continuation Stage]]s that derives from [[First Round (Deadly)]] that is a part of [[The Proving Grounds]]. Beating this stage allows the access of two, random [[Continuation Stage]]s. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[4th Round: Dawn (Merciless)]]
*[[4th Round: Dusk (Merciless)]]

